WEBVTT

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:04.890
As one encounter led to a double romance...

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.700
...three beating hearts...

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.100
...played gentle melodies.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.400
I, Kasuga Kyosuke, 15 years old...

00:00:12.510 --> 00:00:15.030
...am living the best years of my youth!

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:30.350
That's the accelerator screamin',
as the tires are squealin'...

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:36.860
...takin' you along, a girl I hardly knew, in my speedin' coupe.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:42.630
You slammed the door, evadin' the shadows that followed...

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:49.370
...sayin' "Take me anywhere, Just go!"

00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:52.280
An encounter is like a highway junction...

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:55.350
I've fallen in love with you - that I realized...

00:00:55.450 --> 00:01:01.390
...by the time the seaport was in sight...

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.480
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:13.260
Sayin' that you desire tenderness over a caress...

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:16.600
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:25.610
...the way you avoided me, usin' that
naive look, wasn't so innocent.

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:28.910
"Take me to Summer Side"

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:37.690
Sayin' that you desire a caress over loneliness...

00:01:37.790 --> 00:01:41.130
"Night of Summer Side"

00:01:41.230 --> 00:01:51.500
...the way you looked into my eyes as
you turned back wasn't so innocent.

00:01:59.250 --> 00:02:05.190
Feelings Stirred - The Rolling First-Date.

00:02:41.990 --> 00:02:44.890
A... Ayukawa...

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:52.800
Wh... What the...?

00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:55.030
Yo, Kasuga!

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:55.840
Huh?

00:02:55.840 --> 00:02:57.540
Whatcha daydreaming about?
Huh?

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:57.670
Whatcha daydreaming about?

00:02:57.670 --> 00:02:59.070
Oh, nothing...
Whatcha daydreaming about?

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:03.010
Bet you had something dirty on your mind again! You dog!

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.980
Well, at any rate...
Come hang out with us for a bit.

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:08.770
I guarantee it'll be an uplifting experience!

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:11.890
It's all right! Just come with us!

00:03:12.050 --> 00:03:14.250
Hey!

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:30.230
"Fashion Bldg. Aerobics Jun. Osam-Burger"

00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:33.370
Ta-da! Here we are!

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:41.010
Why, it's just a burger joint.

00:03:41.180 --> 00:03:43.150
It's all right! Just come on!

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.060
Welcome!

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:51.020
Oh!

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:55.590
Huh? Is anything wrong, sir?

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:58.060
Th...That outfit...

00:03:58.670 --> 00:04:01.270
Everyone who works here wears leotards!

00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:03.130
See? Isn't that great?

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.470
I'll have a hamburger and a small cola!

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.910
Oh, I'll have a cheeseburger
and a medium orange juice.

00:04:09.080 --> 00:04:10.410
And, you, sir?

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:14.280
Oh! Me? A hamburger
and an iced milk, please.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:18.720
Thank you, sirs. Please be seated upstairs.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.050
Hey, let's go.

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:22.320
C'mon, hurry up!
Hey, let's go.

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:25.990
1, 2, 3, 4... 1, 2, 3, 4...

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:29.490
1, 2, 3, 4... 1, 2, 3...

00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:31.930
Second one from the right...

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:33.420
Third from the left...
Second one from the right...

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.800
Legs up higher!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:39.400
Come on! 1, 2, 3, 4... 1, 2...

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.580
Now I get it!

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:57.450
Did you drag me here so I could see this?!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.860
See? I told you it was great, didn't I?

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.490
Thanks.
See? I told you it was great, didn't I?

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.100
And there's more! More good news!

00:05:03.100 --> 00:05:03.900
Eh...?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.500
Look!

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:06.590
Huh...?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.030
A "Ladies-Admitted-Free"
Ticket to Disco Möebius?!

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:13.970
What the...?! Delinquents
hang out at discos, don't they?

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:17.540
You're so lame! Talk about old-fashioned!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:21.010
But, I know that Ayukawa goes there,
so... yeah, delinquents do go there a lot!

00:05:21.350 --> 00:05:23.940
What?! Ayukawa goes to discos?!

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:26.280
Besides, how can you say "No" to "Cheek Time...?"

00:05:26.390 --> 00:05:28.320
Slowly and softly, cheek to cheek...

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.130
Ayukawa...

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:54.550
Yo, Kasuga! Kasuga! Hey!

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.510
Well? Not bad, eh? Let's go to the disco!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:06:00.590
We'll take Kurumi and Manami along too!

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:03.450
Maybe that's not such a good idea, after all.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:08.260
They're still kids... And they're not
ready for discos. Not yet, at least.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:09.900
Think so? Look!

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.060
I want a pink leotard too!

00:06:18.240 --> 00:06:20.170
I'd be too embarrassed to wear one!

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:22.730
C'mon! Get busy! Go for it!
I'd be too embarrassed to wear one!

00:06:39.760 --> 00:06:42.030
What...?! Stop leering at them!

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:44.000
Whaddya mean?!

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:55.970
Say what?! A coupon for a free lesson?!

00:06:56.540 --> 00:07:00.410
Yessiree... It was just once,
and they said it was free, so...

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:05.540
Once is enough! If you keep dancing there,
I'll be totally humiliated!

00:07:15.230 --> 00:07:17.200
See, I knew he'd be mad at us!

00:07:17.370 --> 00:07:19.230
But, wasn't it awesome?

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:20.870
Totally!

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:29.970
Sheesh... Listen, you're not to go there ever again!

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:31.740
Okay...

00:07:32.410 --> 00:07:33.740
Having said that...

00:07:33.850 --> 00:07:36.110
...the fact that I couldn't
say no to Komatsu and Hatta...

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.340
...and accepted the tickets...

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:41.350
...means that such
an irresponsible person as myself...

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:44.150
...has no business lecturing
his sisters on morality.

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.560
Oniichan!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:26.020
Oniichan!
Oniichan!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.730
Hey! Wake up, Oniichan!

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:31.270
What's up?

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:33.070
What's with this?!
What's up?

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:33.210
What's with this?!

00:08:33.210 --> 00:08:35.510
It's nothing! Nothing!

00:08:35.610 --> 00:08:37.240
Wasn't there another one?

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:39.180
I knew it!

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:42.410
All of a sudden, Kurumi said
she was going to a friend's place...

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:43.370
What?!

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:02.330
What's taking them so long?!

00:09:05.610 --> 00:09:06.710
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:07.780
Huh?
Thanks for waiting!

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:07.910
Huh?

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.380
Sorry about that!

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:12.450
You won't believe how tough it was
to sneak out without Mom seeing me!

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.550
Where's Kurumi... and Manami?

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:20.710
Oh!

00:09:20.820 --> 00:09:23.380
Th... That's...!

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:26.290
H...Hey... don't tell me that's a...

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.250
Huh? What's what?

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:31.830
Well, we'll be in a disco,
so I figure that stuff like this...

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:34.900
...will make it more fun,
like a party or something!

00:09:35.070 --> 00:09:37.040
Y...Yeah, of course!

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:41.470
Did you... think it was something else?!
It's only a rubber balloon!

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:43.900
They'd better get here soon!

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.420
Welcome.

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:51.380
Oh... Hello!
Welcome.

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:53.380
First time here...
We need to work on our entrance...

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:22.000
Yeah! Awesome! Awesome!
Awesome! Meow!

00:10:22.720 --> 00:10:24.620
The noise was incredible.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.280
If it's true that Ayukawa comes to
a place like this often, then...

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:36.490
Hey, hey, hey... Hey!

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:41.390
...to put it simply, the Ayukawa
that I know, from school...

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:43.400
...or from when it's just the two of us...

00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:48.410
...has another, completely different life,
or so it seems.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.600
Bastard! Huh...?!

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:55.810
Oh! Hikaru!

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:57.510
Darling!

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:59.780
No way! No way!
This can't be happening!

00:11:00.520 --> 00:11:04.220
Hmm, he doesn't seem to be the type,
but he hangs out at discos too!

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:06.690
If she's here, then maybe...

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:09.360
Um... Did you come here alone?

00:11:09.530 --> 00:11:12.400
Oh, no. Madoka came with me.
See, over there.

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:20.540
Ayukawa!

00:11:23.610 --> 00:11:25.670
Ayukawa's...

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.910
Say, would you like to dance with me?

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:33.320
Huh? Oh! Er... well, I didn't intend to...

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:40.920
Yeah! Okay, okay! Y'all are one
happenin' bunch, boys and girls!

00:11:41.030 --> 00:11:43.830
Let's face it! Whatever happens,
happens, you're on your own!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.730
All right, let's go for it!
It's "Cheek Time!"

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:56.800
Do you know how to... slow dance?

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:58.500
Huh?! Oh! Well... no.

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:01.650
It's easy... Like this!

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:12.560
It was incredible... I smelled something
really sweet and lemony...

00:12:20.070 --> 00:12:22.260
Ayukawa!

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.970
Is something wrong, Darling?

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.110
Er... no, it's nothing!

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:38.550
One more...

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.480
Well? Isn't the pizza great here?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:43.280
Yum! Let's go home after we finish this!

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:46.360
Ayukawa...

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:49.220
I can't believe that she's dancing
with an ugly bozo like that!

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:50.920
Having said that...

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:53.360
...here I am, right where she can see me...

00:12:53.470 --> 00:12:56.990
..."giving cheek," so...

00:12:57.100 --> 00:13:01.060
...I don't have the right to sit
in judgment, or so it seems...

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:09.680
I think... my head was...
all messed up inside...

00:13:10.480 --> 00:13:13.650
...and what Hikaru
asked me at that moment...

00:13:14.290 --> 00:13:18.190
...put me in a really awkward position...

00:13:18.290 --> 00:13:21.130
...no, it was something
I should've been glad to hear...

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:25.920
...but I just couldn't decide
how to react to it, or so it seemed...

00:13:35.980 --> 00:13:39.740
What's taking Kasuga and the gang so long?!

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:43.540
That punk! He's dead meat for sure!

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:05.180
"North Entrance"

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:07.580
It happened so suddenly...

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:10.550
...that it was a shock, but...

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:12.520
"What?! A date?!"

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:15.250
"Well? How about it? Tomorrow, Sunday."

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.590
"W... W... Sure..."

00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:21.560
"Yeah?! Lucky me! Happy me!"

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:24.160
"Lucky!" eh?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:29.090
12 o'clock? I got here an hour early!

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:33.100
Can't be helped.
It's my first date, after all!

00:14:37.810 --> 00:14:40.780
We're supposed to meet here at one.

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:56.460
There's a pond over there!

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:59.960
I've got some time to kill... so why don't
I take a boat ride or something?!

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:03.900
What?! He went out?!

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.400
This sucks! He promised to meet us here!

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:07.840
That's odd...

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.910
He promised...? What pro...?

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:11.310
Dork!
He promised...? What pro...?

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:14.680
Oh, yes! He did promise!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.880
That's too bad.

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:18.780
Too bad, we were supposed to
treat him to some really good food.

00:15:18.950 --> 00:15:20.020
Tasty food?!

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:23.650
Yeah! Coupons for free pizza, see!

00:15:24.960 --> 00:15:27.790
Pizza! Did you hear that?
Manami, let's go! Let's go!

00:15:29.630 --> 00:15:31.570
Huh? Is something wrong?

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:33.440
Why, you...!

00:15:33.440 --> 00:15:36.060
I can't breathe... Wh... What the...?

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.470
What the hell are you thinking,
you airhead?!

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:02.920
Ahh! Feels nice!

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:14.300
Sheesh... How could Ayukawa
be with such a bozo...?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.160
Ayukawa!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:43.900
At that moment I wondered... why did I...

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:45.970
...why did I choose to hide...?

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:55.570
You were so cruel! Didn't you know
I was waiting for ya last night?

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:57.910
I didn't expect to get the brush-off like that!

00:16:58.020 --> 00:17:01.250
But, considering how pretty you are... I'll forgive ya!

00:17:01.360 --> 00:17:06.020
You can make it up to me by hanging out
with us all day. Well...? All right?

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:11.800
Let's get going. I know a great joint.

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:16.400
One slow-dance with me doesn't
give you the right to get cocky.

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:20.270
What did you just say? You wanna run
it through for me one more time?

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:24.670
Easy, easy! She's the kind that doesn't
mean it when she says "no." Right?

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:28.120
Piss off.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:33.320
Y...You bitch! You've got a big mouth!

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:35.720
I think you need a good butt-kicking
to teach you a lesson.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:39.990
Oh... Oh, no!

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:41.960
I'm coming!

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:02.380
Ayukawa! I'll be right there!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:09.650
Huh...?!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:12.360
Kasuga! What's going on?

00:18:12.360 --> 00:18:14.520
Wh... er... well... you know...

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:26.710
"Pizza Restaurant 'Nine Seas"'

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:28.740
Manami, the salami's great, isn't it?
"Pizza Restaurant 'Nine Seas"'

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:28.880
"Pizza Restaurant 'Nine Seas"'

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:29.040
Komatsu! Hatta! Why aren't you eating?
This is really great!
"Pizza Restaurant 'Nine Seas"'

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:31.380
Komatsu! Hatta! Why aren't you eating?
This is really great!

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:31.550
Yeah!

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:33.450
Yeah!
Yeah!

00:18:34.950 --> 00:18:36.920
Kurumi's in heaven!

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:49.190
Excuse me, another mixed pizza...!

00:18:49.300 --> 00:18:52.200
...if I may?

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:54.840
"...if I may...?"
Y...Yes, of course you may!

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:56.540
Why don't you eat as much as you want!

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:57.610
Yippee!

00:18:57.610 --> 00:18:58.730
Then, me too!

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:01.930
Excuse me, may I get another
mixed pizza, please?!

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:07.180
Hey, that's it for the free coupons!
How much money did you bring?!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:08.580
I've got 1,500 yen...

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.920
I've got 1,000...
I've got 1,500 yen...

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:24.290
Don't laugh!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:27.770
I'm not laughing.

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:30.040
Oh, yeah?!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:32.570
Why don't you take 'em off to dry?

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:33.840
That might be a good idea!

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:37.340
Yeah, right! Right in front of a girl!

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:41.040
But... right then,
Ayukawa looked so full of joy.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:45.250
Why in the world does she always act like she's so indifferent?

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:47.950
I couldn't help but wonder why...

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:50.820
Oh, I was wondering...

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:51.930
What is it?

00:19:51.930 --> 00:19:52.730
Oh... er... Do you come to the park often?
What is it?

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:55.590
Oh... er... Do you come to the park often?

00:19:55.760 --> 00:19:57.730
Every now and then.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:01.160
Sho!

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.960
Ma... Mama!

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:08.370
Oh, no! Huh...? Ayukawa!

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:14.010
I...I'm not exactly too confident
when it comes to swimming...

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.520
...but... in this case...

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:17.890
Ayukawa!

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:18.720
Huh?
Ayukawa!

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:18.850
Huh?

00:20:18.850 --> 00:20:21.320
I'll go!

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.320
That's right! I've gotta try!

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:28.020
I did my best...

00:20:28.130 --> 00:20:32.460
It felt like it was the first time that
I had to do my very best...

00:20:32.570 --> 00:20:36.230
And, it wasn't just to save
the kid, but because...

00:20:36.740 --> 00:20:40.730
...somehow, Ayukawa seemed to
be so much more grown up...

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:43.140
...so maybe I was trying my best to catch up to her...

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:47.110
...or so it seemed to me...

00:21:35.930 --> 00:21:39.530
Wh...What is it? Is there something on my face?

00:21:39.700 --> 00:21:40.900
Plankton.

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.870
What?
Plankton.

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:46.530
Oh, come on! There's no way
you can see stuff like that!

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:51.210
Being together like this, you and I...

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:52.870
...it looks like we're dating, doesn't it?

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:54.610
A date, eh?

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:57.510
A date?!

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:00.620
Oh, shoot! My date with Hikaru!

00:22:02.090 --> 00:22:03.460
What date with Hikaru?!

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:05.890
Um... um... well...

00:22:09.230 --> 00:22:12.670
I just remembered!
I have to be running along.

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:15.570
I'll take care of this. See ya.

00:22:15.770 --> 00:22:18.400
Oh! What about your jacket?!

00:22:18.570 --> 00:22:21.510
Be sure to wash it
before you return it to me.

00:22:24.310 --> 00:22:28.480
I, Kasuga Kyosuke...
have screwed up bigtime.

00:22:38.490 --> 00:22:40.890
Bulletin Board:"Kyosuke, you jerk!"

00:23:15.630 --> 00:23:17.260
"If you start to smoke at a young age...

00:23:17.370 --> 00:23:19.460
"...you won't be able
to have healthy babies!"

00:23:25.370 --> 00:23:27.900
Strange kid...

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:14.280
I dream of casting a spell that captures your heart...

00:24:14.390 --> 00:24:21.850
...and makes you crazy about me.

00:24:21.960 --> 00:24:37.210
Love is deja vu; an unfamiliar memory.
I feel our lips pressing together.

00:24:37.310 --> 00:24:49.820
Love me... tenderly...
Golden Summer Mirage...

00:24:49.920 --> 00:25:00.030
Someday... Someday...
Please let my body feel your lips...

00:25:00.130 --> 00:25:07.040
...on that morning I'll be called your lover.

00:25:07.140 --> 00:25:18.480
Someday, someday...
I'll be waiting for that moment.

00:25:21.690 --> 00:25:24.390
Ayukawa! Please believe me!

00:25:24.490 --> 00:25:29.360
Hikaru and I had a "C Experience."
It's a terrible misunderstanding!
"A" = Kissing. "B" = Petting.
"C" = Sex. "D" = Pregnancy!

00:25:29.460 --> 00:25:32.860
What really happened was that,
Hikaru came to visit me when I was sick...

00:25:32.970 --> 00:25:36.430
...and we were just
sitting on my bed chatting.

00:25:36.540 --> 00:25:40.700
Next time: "Hikaru?!
A Sensational"C" Experience."

00:25:40.810 --> 00:25:43.680
I'm... screwed.
